---
description: Grok is the only AI provider
alwaysApply: true
---

All LLM/AI features MUST use xAI Grok (`XAI_API_KEY`, `https://api.x.ai/v1`, default model `grok-4.6`). Use `src/lib/ai.ts` on the server. Never add OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, or other providers. Never call an LLM from the browser.
